            "sid": "ISA 61:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Spiritu yaMwanta Nzambi wudi hadami; muloŋa Yehova nanwayishi dehi manji nishimuni atuzwepi nsaŋu yayiwahi; nantemeshikulonda nikasakasi chachiwahi abaluka nyichima, ankoli niyibidiki jakusubuka, akasewa niyibidiki jakuyenzulula; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibidiki mwaka waYehova wunawahi, niifuku daNzambi yetu dakutenda; nikundeji antu ejima akudila; akudila muZiyona niyitoŋweli kuyinka chibaaba chakuhiŋa mwadiŋi mawuti, nimanji akuzaŋa ajala nachu ahiŋa mwadiŋi kudila, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niihina dakushimeka nachu dihiŋa mwadiŋi muchima wazeya; kulonda akayitenaŋa nawu, Yenu nyitondu yakuloŋa, yenu atumbawu kudi Yehova, kulondaku mwekesha nachu lubanji lwindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akatuŋa cheŋi mumahembi amakulu, akahindula cheŋi matala akisikili dehi kunyaka, akaloŋesha cheŋi nyikalayafwili dehi, yakisikili dehi kumakipu amavulu, mufwawa muhiŋawa, mufwawa muhiŋa awa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu akwacheŋi diwu akemanaŋa nakudiisha yimuna yenu, antu akumpata jacheŋi diwu akayidiminaŋa, diwu akayiloŋeshelaŋa nyivinyuyenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila enu akayitumba ijina nawu, Yenu atupristu twaYehova; akayitenaŋa nawu, Yenu akwakumukalakela Nzambi yetu. Mwakadya maheta awajentili, mwakadisamba nakulema kwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munsonyi yimwatiyili akayihipi shilamu muyedi, mwadiro kubaya wuwabulili kwiluka kuluŋa nesekadawu. Dichi mwituŋa dawu akatambwilamu muyedi; akamona kuluŋakwahaya nyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
